# AYCT — Amaze Youth Chess Tournament

Static website for the Amaze Youth Chess Tournament (AYCT), organized and managed by Amaze Consortium.

## Structure

```
index.html      AYCT 26 main site (home page)
ayct27.html     AYCT 27 "coming soon" / interest-registration page
styles.css      Shared stylesheet for both pages
script.js       Shared JS: nav menu, scroll animations (GSAP/ScrollTrigger), Lenis smooth scroll
ayctlogo.png    Site logo
chm.png         Hero background image (index.html)
img/            Local content images (see below) — not included in this repo
```

## Required local images

`index.html` references the following images under `img/`, which must be added before deploying:

- `img/rhyme.jpg` — 2nd place champion photo
- `img/azmaeen.jpg` — 1st place champion photo
- `img/sazzad.jpg` — 3rd place champion photo
- `img/jnu.jpg` — venue photo (Jagannath University)
- `img/ayct1.jpg` … `img/ayct6.jpg` — gallery photos

If an image fails to load, `script.js` automatically hides the broken-image icon and shows a placeholder, so the site still renders correctly without these files — but add them for the real content to appear.

## External dependencies (CDN)

Loaded via `<script>` tags, in this order:

1. GSAP — https://unpkg.com/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js
2. GSAP ScrollTrigger — https://unpkg.com/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js
3. Lenis (smooth scroll) — https://unpkg.com/lenis@1.3.19/dist/lenis.min.js
4. `script.js` (this repo)

Fonts (Geist, Geist Mono) are loaded from Google Fonts.

## Before deploying

- Replace the Google Form placeholder in `ayct27.html` (`REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_FORM_ID`, both the embedded `<iframe>` and the fallback link) with your published Google Form URL.
- Add the images listed above under `img/`.

## Local development

No build step — open `index.html` directly in a browser, or serve the folder with any static file server, e.g.:

```
npx serve .
```